ation":["요즘"]},{"id":"24739b6fce9af9a8","term":"줄무늬","zh":"条纹","audio":"/audio/24739b6fce9af9a8ca68.mp3","entryId":"91871","definition":"由多个条形组成的花纹。","pronunciation":["줄무니"]},{"id":"f977ac4486c2b67c","term":"티셔츠","zh":"T恤","audio":"/audio/f977ac4486c2b67cd296.mp3","entryId":"82674","definition":"“T”字形的短袖衬衫。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"4e036fa50e83b243","term":"유행","zh":"流行，时尚，时髦","audio":"/audio/4e036fa50e83b243700b.mp3","entryId":"70900","definition":"某个事物受人欢迎，在整个社会广泛传播。","pronunciation":["유행"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0b269c2e57468ed434bc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89253-1-11-2","ko":"응, 사람들이 흔하게 입고 다니네.","zh":"对，大家都经常穿呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"흔하게","meaning":"常见，寻常","explanation":"흔하다：常见，寻常；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"흔하다","audio":"/audio/5ee0ee0b7671b63c647a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89253","senseId":"1","lemma":"흔하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흔하게","audio":"/audio/1c7e6fe294804504c47e.mp3"}},{"text":"입고","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입고","audio":"/audio/abf4f911317e9d7bed28.mp3"}},{"text":"다니네.","meaning":"走动、外出（穿着到处走）","explanation":"입고 다니다：穿着某种衣服在外活动；此处不是经常去某一个地方。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"4","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다니네","audio":"/audio/24a5680e2cc8145c8f33.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"5ee0ee0b7671b63c","term":"흔하다","zh":"常见，寻常","audio":"/audio/5ee0ee0b7671b63c647a.mp3","entryId":"89253","definition":"比普通的更多或总是发生，容易遇见。","pronunciation":["흔하다"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"走动、外出（穿着到处走）","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"走动、外出（穿着到处走）","pronunciation":["다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a8eae890dd6c10e12e6c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.44,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89253","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":82,"sequenceScore":2.2667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对，大家都经常穿呢。","我都打过针了，还是不明白为什么病还没好。","看来最近条纹T恤很流行啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对，大家都经常穿呢。","看来最近条纹T恤很流行啊。","我都打过针了，还是不明白为什么病还没好。"],"answer":0}]}
